    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκτρα</span></b> , τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Balkh,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.113
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				833b14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.8.9
			</span></i>: the people were <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκτριοι</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.102
			</span></i>; or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βακτριανοί</span></b> ,
			Str.l.c.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βακτριανή, ἡ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				11.9.2
			</span></i>:—the Bactrian camels were famous, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				498b8
			</span></i>.</div>
